description	"The ARC Trooper

Based on open mode's Arc Trooper class, the standard variant invests into the scoped version of the Arc trooper rifle plus a pair of super charged pistols. Like other classes in super open mode its health and armor have been significantly increased. 

^2Weaponry:
- Dual DC-17 Pistols (4)
- Westar M5 w/ Scope (1)
- DC-15A Blaster Rifle (1)

^8Attributes:
- Stamina + Dexterity (3)
- CTF: 32s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Grapple Hook (2) ^3[CS3 Melee]

^2Strengths^7: Very Thick Armor, good against sith classes, powerful dual pistols, and fields weapons for short, medium, and long range.
^1Weaknesses^7: No particular weaknesses"